{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire","id":1488888,"title":"Did any of you see the trailer for the remake of Anne Rices's \"Interview with the Vampire\"?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-02T14:57:27-07:00","id":1488888,"title":"Did any of you see the trailer for the remake of Anne Rices's \"Interview with the Vampire\"?","content":"Didn't watch much of the trailer, but read a bit of the comments. Looks like many people in the comments didnt really feel there was a need for the remake. I wasnt born yet when the original movie came out, so I dont really understand the hype, seems like an interesting premise though.<br /> <br /> Here's the trailer <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uf0omSx_l7o\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uf0omSx_l7o</a><br /> <br /> What are your opinions on this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":27313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","user":"Hello","date":". 08-02-2022, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T15:12:17-07:00","id":1488891,"title":"","content":"The original movie had the benefit of surprising everyone. When Tom Cruise was cast for Lestat, everyone freaked out and said it was a bad idea, the author included. Most people thought of him as just Maverick or the kid from Risky Business. <br /> <br /> But this was thankfully (just) before the Web was taking off, so while there was some bad buzz it wasn't enough to completely poison everyone's attitude towards it. If the buzz did a disservice to anyone, it was all the great talent <i>besides</i> Tom Cruise. The movie has Kirsten Dunst, Antonio Banderas, and of course, Christian Slater and Brad Pitt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T15:13:27-07:00","id":1488892,"title":"","content":"Well the person behind the remarke was the late Anne Rice who wanted a more faithful adaptation of her books than QUEEN OF THE DAMNED but given Louis an African American pimp, Claudia is 19 going on 14, and they meet in the 1920s--I don't think that's happening.<br /> <br /> Also, the first season is only the 1st third of the 1st book so we'll never see an adaptation of the other books.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage 