 the remarke was the late Anne Rice who wanted a more faithful adaptation of her books than QUEEN OF THE DAMNED but given Louis an African American pimp, Claudia is 19 going on 14, and they meet in the 1920s--I don't think that's happening.<br /> <br /> Also, the first season is only the 1st third of the 1st book so we'll never see an adaptation of the other books.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Wait, are they seriously going to fuck the book premise that much? I will never understand why the big heads behind these projects do this kind of stuff, you have the books and you have the characters, why change them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T15:38:59-07:00","id":1488894,"title":"","content":"i actually am pleseantly surprised! Jacob Anderson doesn't look the part,but boy he can act pretty great. and the rest seem to be on the same boat","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T15:41:25-07:00","id":1488895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488893#post1488893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, are they seriously going to fuck the book premise that much? I will never understand why the big heads behind these projects do this kind of stuff, you have the books and you have the characters, why change them?</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine the developers hoped to add some color to the cast and noted that a plantation owner (ignoring he's also a serial killer as a vampire--even if he feels bad about it) was a hard selling point.<br /> <br /> And it snowballed from there.<br /> <br /> Elisa Hasen, my dear friend, did a review of the trailer and you can slowly see her degenerating into frenzy.<br /> <br /> It's an hour of entertainment worth watching.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/sL08_3fgkLk\" data-code=\"sL08_3fgkLk\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/sL08_3fgkLk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T16:59:05-07:00","id":1488904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488895#post1488895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I imagine the developers hoped to add some color to the cast and noted that a plantation owner (ignoring he's also a serial killer as a vampire--even if he feels bad about it) was a hard selling point.<br /> <br /> And it snowballed from there.<br /> <br /> Elisa Hasen, my dear friend, did a review of the trailer and you can slowly see her degenerating into frenzy.<br /> <br /> It's an hour of entertainment worth watching.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/sL08_3fgkLk\" data-code=\"sL08_3fgkLk\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/sL08_3fgkLk/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I swear this guys seriously need a reality check &quot;let's see, we have an immortal bloodsucking monster who kills a fuckton of people while moping about it, such empathy and humanity but wait, he is a plantation owner, we can't have that in our horror series, let's change it into a black pimp and set it in the 1920's for no reason whatsoever, also the vampire child is creepy (who would have thought?), let's make her 19 shall we?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T18:02:56-07:00","id":1488910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488904#post1488904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I swear this guys seriously need a reality check &quot;let's see, we have an immortal bloodsucking monster who kills a fuckton of people while moping about it, such empathy and humanity but wait, he is a plantation owner, we can't have that in our horror series, let's change it into a black pimp and set it in the 1920's for no reason whatsoever, also the vampire child is creepy (who would have thought?), let's make her 19 shall we?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Apparently, they were annoyed that New Orleans labor laws didn't let her work as much as they wanted her to so they hired a 19 year old actress to play a 14 year old.<br /> <br /> Which is about the point this was a trainwreck.<br /> <br /> I mean, I love the history of New Orleans and Storyville but you are WAYYYYY off Interview now.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T19:11:59-07:00","id":1488917,"title":"","content":"I'm not one of those people who demands that movies be faithful to books or the media they're based on, but it doesn't look much of anything like Interview with the Vampire. So far it seems like they wanted to make a vampire movie involving New Orleans and just called it &quot;Interview with the Vampire&quot; in order to cash in on the name rather than try and create a new IP which probably wouldn't sell as well. The problem for is that if I watch it, the whole time I'll be comparing it to Interview with the Vampire and it'll probably end up leaving me feeling more annoyed than anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T19:18:13-07:00","id":1488919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488904#post1488904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I swear this guys seriously need a reality check &quot;let's see, we have an immortal bloodsucking monster who kills a fuckton of people while moping about it, such empathy and humanity but wait, he is a plantation owner, we can't have that in our horror series, let's change it into a black pimp and set it in the 1920's for no reason whatsoever, also the vampire child is creepy (who would have thought?), let's make her 19 shall we?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The problem is vampires are fantasy, so treating someone as tragic to be stuck in that state is pretty big jump away from expecting 2022 audiences to be cool with a plantation owner (not fantasy) as a tragic protagonist we\u2019re meant to have empathy for.<br /> <br /> I do agree that how creepy child vampires are should be embraced as part of the horror, rather than fled - but with a tv series you run into a major problem a movie doesn\u2019t have in that your actress will visibly age by next season.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m open to judging this work on its own merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-02-2022, 10:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T19:41:41-07:00","id":1488924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488919#post1488919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The problem is vampires are fantasy, so treating someone as tragic to be stuck in that state is pretty big jump away from expecting 2022 audiences to be cool with a plantation owner (not fantasy) as a tragic protagonist we\u2019re meant to have empathy for.<br /> <br /> I do agree that how creepy child vampires are should be embraced as part of the horror, rather than fled - but with a tv series you run into a major problem a movie doesn\u2019t have in that your actress will visibly age by next season.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m open to judging this work on its own merits.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand their logic but I feel like the more you tweak it, the more it ceases to be the Vampire Chronicles. I'm giving it a chance, though, because Anne Rice apparently approved all these changes.<br /> <br /> I admit, I am more excited about HOUSE OF THE DRAGON though because it'll be more faithful to Martin's <i>Fire and Blood</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T20:38:05-07:00","id":1488927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hello</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire#post1488888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wasnt born yet when the original movie came out, so I dont really understand the hype, seems like an interesting premise though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ever heard of the <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeinfeldIsUnfunny\" target=\"_blank\">'&quot;Seinfeld&quot; is unfunny'</a> effect?<br /> <br /> You'll find a big part of it just standard vampire movie, but that's actually because it was the genre codifier of modern vampire movies. It did all the clich\u00e9s before they were clich\u00e9, which still means it did all the clich\u00e9s, so you do risk finding it lame.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T20:44:15-07:00","id":1488928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488927#post1488927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ever heard of the <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeinfeldIsUnfunny\" target=\"_blank\">'&quot;Seinfeld&quot; is unfunny'</a> effect?<br /> <br /> You'll find a big part of it just standard vampire movie, but that's actually because it was the genre codifier of modern vampire movies. It did all the clich\u00e9s before they were clich\u00e9, which still means it did all the clich\u00e9s, so you do risk finding it lame.</div> </div> </div> </div>V:TM is Fevre Dream + Vampire Chronicles + Lost Boys + Cyberpunk 2020<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T21:23:23-07:00","id":1488933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1488928#post1488928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">V:TM is Fevre Dream + Vampire Chronicles + Lost Boys + Cyberpunk 2020</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually it is <i>Fevre Dream</i> + <i>Lost Boys</i> + Punk metal.<br /> <br /> <i>Fevre Dream</i> is <i>Vampire Chronicles</i>. <i>Lost Boys</i> is <b>also</b> <i>Vampire Chronicles</i>. Mark already said he didn't knew anything <i>Vampire Chronicles</i> by the time he did VtM, but it doesn't matter because everything was <i>Vampire Chronicles</i> by then, at least as far as books go.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't call it <i>Cyberpunk 2020</i> because it has very little futurism and transhumanism to be <i>Neuromancer</i> and too much actual content to be <i>Cyberpunk 2020</i> (I still wonder what people see in that game)<br /> <br /> Just in case anyone is wondering how I can say that a game about immortal vampires raising ever closer to Caine and things like Path of Metamorphosis does not have enough transhumanism to be <i>Neuromancer</i>... <b>yes</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T22:27:14-07:00","id":1488941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hello</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire#post1488888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Didn't watch much of the trailer, but read a bit of the comments. Looks like many people in the comments didnt really feel there was a need for the remake. I wasnt born yet when the original movie came out, so I dont really understand the hype, seems like an interesting premise though.</div> </div> </div> </div>the original novel of Interview with a Vampire is pretty much the origin of the \u201cpersonal horror of being a vampire\u201d horror narrative in pop culture. Vampire the Masquerade, and thus the entire World of Darkness, and thus everything the original White Wolf built on that foundation, and the existence of Onyx Path having been founded by people from the original White Wolf to carry on its work, can all be drawn via a pretty straight line directly from Interview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T10:27:25-07:00","id":1488987,"title":"","content":"Oh god another remake from Hollywood and lets screw it up from the orginial source material to the point that nobody wants to watch it all on general principal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T22:31:38-07:00","id":1489058,"title":"","content":"I believe it's necessary to add or to find a new angle in order to justify a remake's existence; the trailer looks as if this series does that, flirting with just how overtly gay the relationship between Louis and Lestat is and how Louis struggles with guilt and temptation in equal measure. It's a mature take, and one that would have been politically impossible (in cinemas even, let alone on basic cable) when the original film was made.<br /> <br /> I also like the casting. Jacob Anderson carries emotional weight that escaped Brad Pitt at that early stage of his career; you don't want Louis getting upstaged by Lestat until you're doing the second novel, where he becomes the POV character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T01:20:39-07:00","id":1489068,"title":"","content":"Trying to convince AMC to not change things in adapting to TV (and they're not actually part of Hollywood) is pointless because they've made a shit ton of money doing it. AMC's adaptations are frequently very popular with fans despite (and sometime because of) changes to the source material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T02:45:16-07:00","id":1489079,"title":"","content":"The whole idea that you must be faithful to the source material is, in the extent usually meant, bullshit. As <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11599\" data-vbnamecard=\"11599\">Reasor</a> said, you actually need something to justify the remake/new adaptation. By the way, an important consideration here, a lot of people is already claiming the new movie should be faithful to the first movie, but the first movie was already an adaptation that wasn't all that faithful to its actual source.<br /> <br /> But yeah, such a project means bringing the story to a new medium and a new audience, in a different time and place. Remastering is a simpler option for those who just want to see the same movie again, and the book is still easily available to anyone wanting to read. As much as changes hurt the expectations of established fans, catering to these expectations is actually, <b><i>not the point</i></b>. It is curious how much fans tend to feel entitled to the whole attention of the companies holding beloved IPs.<br /> <br /> I recently watched the Ms. Marvel series on Disney +. Yes, as a huge fan of the character since the first comics I found it weird how much they changed her backstory. And you know what? It worked just fine for the MCU. Another story, most of the same qualities, give and take some things, overall enjoyable. Zoe's costume as the original Denver's Ms. Marvel design in Avenger-Con was the perfect not and Kamala complaining that she got the costume all wrong was on spot, no artistic liberty given, just like a real fan.<br /> <br /> Anne Rice herself approved the main changes to the new <i>Interview </i>movie. Before passing away she was consulted and still found the new script with the changes a better representation of her novel in this day and age than the original one. <i>She's the frigging author</i>. And I'm always reminded that Douglas Adams resisted the very notion of committing the <i>Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy </i>to a book because the notion of the story being fixed in a static form was abhorrent to him. He never did or approved it being done twice the same, and in fact the 2005 movie that I saw many a fan furious with because it is just so completely different from the book... was written by Douglas himself more than not, the whole reason why this movie hadn't be released 30 years prior is that Adams feared they would want it too much samey.<br /> <br /> Let art be art, doesn't matter if it is just a &quot;money-grab move&quot;. Bring the adaptation to be judged on its own merits as a story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T05:17:46-07:00","id":1489096,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty Indifferant,the origional was perfect or as close as you can get so it's hard to see what this can bring to the table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T09:17:40-07:00","id":1489120,"title":"","content":"I don't mind minor changes to the source material. But making Louis a black male when in the books he is depicted as white male who was from a well off southern family is not minor.<br /> <br /> I remember how Richard Donnor approached Superman or Peter Jackson approached Lord Of The Rings. Which was respect and have faith in the source material and don't try to be smarter then the orgininal intent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T10:20:30-07:00","id":1489130,"title":"","content":"The first film adaptation took huge liberties with the original story and nobody seems to care.<br /> <br /> Louis is going to be played by a black man with his bacakground changed to make sense on how he's become both rich and self destructive in a way that makes sense for a black man of the time? So?<br /> <br /> The film adaptation had a 33 year old Antonio Banderas playing a 17 year old looking pale skinned blonde Russian vampire (technically Kiev Rus given his real age). In the books, Armand, much like Claudia, is stuck in a less than adult body for eternity (though he's better off as his age wasn't so young) and is known in the vampire community for managing to be an angsty impetus teenager despite being ~500 year old. The entire Paris segment of the original novel was rewritten to give Claudia a more active role, account for dropping Gabrielle from the story completely, and turning Armand into a wiser mentor figure to Louis as a foil to Lestat.<br /> <br /> So yeah, &quot;minor changes only,&quot; would mean the beloved 90s film adaptation of the book is bad. That's not how these things really work. If people liked the first film, they liked it even though there were major changes.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T20:41:42-07:00","id":1489181,"title":"","content":"I can absolutely imagine the toxic fan reaction to Banderas' casting if that movie was being made for the first time now, and he was so great in it that he singlehandedly inspired the creation of a Masquerade-breaking Spanish Catholic vampire clan with an infernalism problem in a certain tabletop role-playing game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T21:15:23-07:00","id":1489182,"title":"","content":"Anne Rice famously took out a two page article in VANITY FAIR and THE NEW YORK TIMES to give her opinion on the original movie. She changed a lot of her opinions on the casting of Tom Cruise and other changes.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.maths.tcd.ie/~forest/vamipre/morecomments.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.maths.tcd.ie/~forest/vam...ecomments.html</a><br /> <br /> Here's her thoughts on it, preserved from the Nineties.<br /> <br /> I strongly recommend reading it as it is both entertaining and informative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":