 lore.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-05T13:10:10-07:00","id":1489261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1488888-did-any-of-you-see-the-trailer-for-the-remake-of-anne-rices-s-interview-with-the-vampire?p=1489247#post1489247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My next question is why a remake? Surely there must be other books and legends about the undead that could have been adapted for films.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>1. The Vampire Chronicles has one of the largest literary fandoms in the world.<br /> <br /> 2. The Vampire Chronicles fans wanted to watch an adaptation and probably still will.<br /> <br /> 3. Anne Rice herself shopped this show around for 30 years.<br /> <br /> I mean, this sounds like a hot mess but I'm going to watch it out of the vein (pun intended) hope that it keeps some of Anne Rice's beautiful world and characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b